# Implementation Plan - Support Rendering Markdown Images

Currently, when uploading images in `CreatePostPage` or `EditPostPage`, the editor inserts Markdown image syntax (e.g., `![image](url)`). However, when the post details or comments are rendered on the page, they are displayed as plain text instead of actual images because the content parsing function does not support Markdown parsing.

This plan details how to implement Markdown image syntax rendering in the post and comment components.

## User Review Required

No breaking changes or significant risks. The change will parse the standard Markdown image syntax (`![alt](url)`) and render it as an `<img>` element.

## Proposed Changes

### Frontend Components

#### [MODIFY] [PostCard.tsx](file:///c:/Dev/CC91/frontend/src/components/PostCard.tsx)

We will modify the `parsePostContent` function in `PostCard.tsx` to recognize and replace the Markdown image syntax with an HTML `<img>` tag.

Since `parsePostContent` already processes HTML escaping and BBCode `[quote]` parsing, we will run the Markdown image replacement after escaping HTML but before sanitizing.

```typescript
// Proposed regex and replacement in parsePostContent:
const imageRegex = /!\[([^\]]*)\]\(([^)]+)\)/g;
html = html.replace(imageRegex, (_, alt, url) => {
  return `<img src="${url}" alt="${alt}" class="cc98-post-image" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; margin: 0.5rem 0; border-radius: var(--cc98-radius);" />`;
});
```

Because DOMPurify is already configured in [sanitize.ts](file:///c:/Dev/CC91/frontend/src/utils/sanitize.ts) to support the `<img>` tag and its `src`/`alt` attributes, these parsed image tags will be rendered safely and correctly.

---

### Unit Tests

#### [MODIFY] [PostCard.test.tsx](file:///c:/Dev/CC91/frontend/src/__tests__/components/PostCard.test.tsx)

We will add a unit test to ensure that Markdown image tags are correctly converted to HTML images and not stripped or rendered as plain text.

```typescript
it('should render markdown images as img tags', () => {
  renderPostCard({ content: 'Check this out: ![my-image](http://example.com/test.png)' });

  const img = screen.getByRole('img', { name: 'my-image' });
  expect(img).toBeInTheDocument();
  expect(img).toHaveAttribute('src', 'http://example.com/test.png');
});
```

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- Run front-end unit tests using Vitest to verify all components and our new test case pass:
  ```powershell
  npm --prefix frontend test
  ```

### Manual Verification
1. Open the application, log in, and navigate to the create post page.
2. Click the image upload button, select an image, and verify it inserts `![image](url)` syntax.
3. Submit the post and view the post detail page; verify the uploaded image renders correctly.
4. Try editing the post to verify the image persists and displays correctly in the edit view preview/final output.

# 实施计划 - 支持渲染 Markdown 图片语法

当前在 `CreatePostPage` 或 `EditPostPage` 编辑器中上传图片时，编辑器会插入 Markdown 图片语法（如 `![image](url)`）。但在帖子详情页或评论列表中展示时，由于内容解析器只进行了简单的 HTML 转义和引用解析，导致这些图片语法被渲染为了纯文本，无法显示图片。

本计划将说明如何修改前端代码，在帖子和评论组件中解析并渲染 Markdown 图片语法。

## 用户评审事项

此修改无破坏性变更，且无高风险。该变更将自动解析标准的 Markdown 图片语法（`![图片描述](图片链接)`）并将其转换为 HTML `<img>` 标签。

## 拟议变更

### 前端组件

#### [修改] [PostCard.tsx](file:///c:/Dev/CC91/frontend/src/components/PostCard.tsx)

我们将修改 `PostCard.tsx` 中的 `parsePostContent` 函数，以便识别并替换 Markdown 图片语法为 HTML 的 `<img>` 标签。

由于 `parsePostContent` 中已经包含了 HTML 转义处理和 `[quote]` 引用解析，我们将在 HTML 转义后、DOMPurify 净化前运行 Markdown 图片的正则匹配与替换。

```typescript
// 建议在 parsePostContent 中添加的正则解析逻辑：
const imageRegex = /!\[([^\]]*)\]\(([^)]+)\)/g;
html = html.replace(imageRegex, (_, alt, url) => {
  return `<img src="${url}" alt="${alt}" class="cc98-post-image" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; margin: 0.5rem 0; border-radius: var(--cc98-radius);" />`;
});
```

由于 [sanitize.ts](file:///c:/Dev/CC91/frontend/src/utils/sanitize.ts) 中配置的 `DOMPurify` 允许名单已包含 `<img>` 标签及其 `src`/`alt` 属性，因此解析出的图片标签将能够安全且正常地渲染。

---

### 单元测试

#### [修改] [PostCard.test.tsx](file:///c:/Dev/CC91/frontend/src/__tests__/components/PostCard.test.tsx)

我们将添加相应的单元测试，以确保 Markdown 图片语法能被正确转换为 HTML 图像，而不会被过滤或渲染为纯文本。

```typescript
it('应该将 markdown 图片渲染为 img 标签', () => {
  renderPostCard({ content: '请看图片：![my-image](http://example.com/test.png)' });

  const img = screen.getByRole('img', { name: 'my-image' });
  expect(img).toBeInTheDocument();
  expect(img).toHaveAttribute('src', 'http://example.com/test.png');
});
```

## 验证计划

### 自动化测试
- 运行前端单元测试（使用 Vitest）以确保所有组件和新测试用例均通过：
  ```powershell
  npm --prefix frontend test
  ```

### 手动验证
1. 打开应用程序并登录，跳转至发帖页面。
2. 点击图片上传按钮，选择文件，验证文本框内插入了 `![image](url)`。
3. 提交帖子并进入帖子详情页，验证上传的图片是否能够正常显示。
4. 尝试编辑该帖子，验证在编辑预览和最终提交后，图片依旧能够正常显示。

